/// Upsampling interpolation filter for 12.8 -> 16 kHz, Q14.
///
/// One fifth-sample resolution: 24 taps at each of five phases, stored
/// phase-interleaved. -1.5 dB at 6 kHz, -55 dB at 8 kHz -- steep, because
